          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.monoova.com/au/core/notification-v1/Notification/resend/:eventId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "eventId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Request a resend"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Generate a Bearer Token",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Token",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.monoova.com/au/security/oauth-v1/Token",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "username": "{{username}}",
              "password": "{{password}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "</br><p> This endpoint will generate a bearer token which is required to call the Monoova PayTo endpoints. Bearer tokens are valid for 24 hours so they need to be regenerated every 24 hours. Once a bearer token has been generated payment agreements can be created, and payments initiated against those agreements. </p></br> This API endpoint uses BASIC Authentication. </br> <style type=\"text/css\"> .tb { table-layout:auto; width:200px;!important } .td { overflow:hidden; white-space:nowrap; text-ove"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}